contentText:
Entertainment legend, global philanthropist and friend of Maya Angelou, Oprah Winfrey has achieved every dream she ever had &#8212; except for one.

In a Tuesday appearance on The Late Show With Stephen Colbert , Winfrey spoke about how she&#8217;s been fortunate to have every one of her wildest wishes come true. The only one that never came to fruition was ending up with her teenage crush.

